'''Carrot''' an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife which was obtainable by purchasing the third tier of the Rare Egg Easter battlepass for 6 [[Rare Eggs]]{{Currency|Egg}} in the [[Easter Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event as since ended

== Appearance ==
It uses the [[Default Knife|default knife]] mesh and contains cartoon carrots on the blade, along with an orange background which fades into a darker orange close to the guard. The guard is green, and the handle is black.

== Trivia ==

* It contains a [[Carrot Gun (2024)|partner gun]] under the same name.
* There used to be a glitch where, if a player equips this knife, it's texture will be displayed as [[Wavy (Knife)]]'s. This glitch has been patched.
